,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4070588235294118,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":211429,\"title\":\"Who Is the Sender?\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vebAlMqwc0xELd55olbFepWnDsF.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.40606060606060607,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":128301,\"title\":\"Argentina 2001\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s3IoJEiipoZVz82gQET4lhZsiZy.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.40535714285714286,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":94842,\"title\":\"Standing in the Time\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8YZ4em5Uoc2u8E1SHwpPPeu4uBp.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.40508474576271186,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":128331,\"title\":\"Maria: The Outlaw Legend\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2XxzltUGmDagZQLTSDkEGDoTOLz.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.40508474576271186,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":94834,\"title\":\"I Turn\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8zPTJId7UVgE26m32iElPoe9KMN.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4036585365853659,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":128406,\"title\":\"Black Swan Lake\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2v131OQVoBrXTKzAM1w9ecjIBy0.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4032608695652174,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":128252,\"title\":\"The Snitch Cartel: Origins\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sjkzeJJOdr59VdkB4BjlSVfJmq2.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"Living a carefree life has begun to take its toll. Jumping into a rollercoaster of a relationship is giving these thrill seekers a taste of feelings beyond joy.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7QaNSEBA3Q9QT5J7NpGmQjXANLg.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2025-08-13\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Wild Ride\",\"overview\":\"Pure meets up with friends at her regular bar and unexpectedly runs into Air, her former lover. She quickly goes over to greet her, only to find that Air has brought along Loft-the younger sister of Lamp, Air's husband. From their very first meeting, Loft is instantly drawn to Pure and suspects that Pure and Air may have been more than just friends.\\n\\nLater, by chance, Loft runs into Pure again and invites her to a restaurant to get to know each other better. Pure begins to feel a sense of warmth and comfort having Loft in her life, yet she still finds herself waiting for Air's return. Meanwhile, the relationship between Lamp and Air begins to waver under family pressure for them to have a child together.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qxxahTqfllmWIP1LrT1skDKMxIe.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-08-13\",\"runtime\":50},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Twisted Turn\",\"overview\":\"Loft tries to get closer to Pure by joining her ceramic class and secretly buys one of her paintings for his mother. There, she runs into Air's mother, Juthamas, who grows suspicious when she recognizes the pen name PureProud-the same as her daughter's ex.\\n\\nAt the same time, a wealthy patron, Khun Jay, commissions Pure's painting and asks her to deliver it in person. Believing the buyer is Loft, Pure agrees-only to realize the event she walks into is none other than Lamp's birthday party.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hLLGA9KZHosfWMk1HakNHCVbSid.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-08-20\",\"runtime\":53},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Warning Light\",\"overview\":\"Air and Lamp left for their honeymoon in France, leaving Pure without seeing them for several days. During that time, Pure felt heartbroken that Air no longer expressed feelings for her as she once did. Longing for comfort, she decided to visit Loft in Cha-Am, bringing along the pair of ceramic cups she had just finished crafting. That meeting drew them closer together, and for a fleeting moment, Pure found herself forgetting the sorrow of missing Air.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ru4T1tZvm2hNZ6mwrE1HEmKurtm.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-08-27\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Gravity Lust\",\"overview\":\"Pure and Loft's relationship begins to grow deeper, while Air starts to sense a change in Pure after returning from France. Determined to settle things quickly, Air tries to clarify her own relationship with Lamp. Meanwhile, Loft visits Pure more frequently, and the two gradually become closer-far beyond the bond of mere acquaintances or siblings.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fjGR9bq6NTa5Oy8FtmCYNmrq7KS.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-09-03\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Reverse Loop\",\"overview\":\"Air decided on getting a divorce from Lamp and explained it to Juthamas, but Juthamas refused to accept it. Air then went back to Pure, asking her to wait because she was about to finalize the divorce. Pure, however, began to hesitate, unsure whether the one she truly loved was Air or Loft.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wzyoRqcC7GxRYjJlFBNtmp7uyzO.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-09-10\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Exit Maze\",\"overview\":\"When Loft discovered that her brother Lamp was about to divorce Air, her heart sank, for she knew her own fleeting moments with Pure were about to end. With tears in her eyes, she went to bid Pure one final, aching farewell. At the very same time, Air returned to Pure-only to find that the love once shared between them had already faded. Crushed and trembling, Air urged Pure to bare her heart to the man she truly cared for, even as her own world was crumbling for being too late to reclaim the love she had lost.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/72Keypsvyf0xhM10jr4XkDtrdeV.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-09-17\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Endless Ride\",\"overview\":\"Pure went to the pool villa, hoping to win Loft back, but was devastated to see her with another woman. Meanwhile, Air tried to move on from her feelings for Pure and decided to return Pure's condo keycard, only to find her room empty. Wondering who Pure truly loved, Air looked at the painting Pure had made and was stunned to discover that the one Pure's heart longed for was Loft. Overwhelmed, Air resolved to confront Loft at the pool villa.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pz841bn1dMrEfn8Ld0uylkskMbX.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-09-24\",\"runtime\":46},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"The End of Air Pure Loft\",\"overview\":\"Pure and Loft, burdened with guilt for hurting Air, chose to part ways and vowed never to meet again. Years went by, and each of them followed a different path. Pure held an exhibition of her work, where she unexpectedly met Lamp and asked about Air and Loft. Air was preparing to move abroad permanently, while Loft had devoted herself to running a pool villa business in the countryside, rarely returning to Bangkok. One day, Pure went back to the familiar restaurant where she used to dine with both Loft and Air-and there, she finally encountered the one she had been waiting for all along.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bPxSOnVoqDkVbi0FSKPI9AWbtm4.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-10-01\",\"runtime\":44}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2025-08-13\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}